UID:weekly_case_review_20260817-20260823@samos
DTSTAMP:20000101T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260823
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260824
SUMMARY:Weekly case review: Full-thickness rectal prolapse with fecal incon
 tinence
DESCRIPTION:Vacation rule: optional\; skip without catch-up guilt\nVacation
  target: 10 SCORE questions\, then enjoy the day\nModules: Hemorrhoids\; P
 rocedures for Hemorrhoids\; Anal Dysplasia and STDs\; Perianal Condylomas
  Excision\; Fecal Incontinence\; Rectal Prolapse\; Rectal Prolapse Repair\
 nAnki: 10 minutes\; make up to 3 cards from missed or guessed questions\nC
 ase: Full-thickness rectal prolapse with fecal incontinence\nOperation: He
 morrhoidectomy\nAnatomy: Anal canal\, sphincter complex\, and hemorrhoidal
  columns\nComplication: Post-hemorrhoidectomy bleeding\nAnswer: What do I
  do first? What changes management? When do I call for help?\nCapture one
  pearl\, one uncertainty\, and one follow-up topic
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
