DTSTAMP:20000101T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261227
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261228
SUMMARY:Monthly finance meeting
DESCRIPTION:Review checking\, savings\, brokerage\, and retirement balances
 \nReview bills\, debt\, and the prior month's spending\nUpdate net worth a
 nd identify upcoming large expenses\nChoose one financial action for the n
 ext month\nLink the newest finance worksheet after it is added to SamOS
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:weight_training_back_and_arms-20261227@samos
DTSTAMP:20000101T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261227
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261228
SUMMARY:Weight training: Back and arms
DESCRIPTION:Weighted pull-ups - 5 x 5\nBodyweight pull-ups - 3 sets\, stopp
 ing 1-2 reps before failure\nChest-supported rows - 4 x 8-12\nOne-arm dumb
 bell rows - 3 x 10 each side\nFace pulls - 4 x 20\nLeaning lateral raises
  - 5 x 15\nDead hangs - 3 x 60 seconds\nHanging leg raises - 3 x 15\nFinis
 h: 10-minute BJJ flow - shrimp\, reverse shrimp\, bridges\, technical stan
 d-ups\, sit-throughs\, sprawls\, and Granby rolls
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
